*** Settings ***
Documentation     [SUITE PURPOSE]
...    This suite tests the scenario of adding two TDD SCells with Beamforming enabled and Beam Refinement
...    deactivated for a single UE registered in FDD FR1 Cell. The test is performed on a 5G Classical SA CMWV
...    cloud test line with a SANSA FS CPRI CMWV FDD+ECPRI CMWV TDD AZQJ variant. It uses a configuration with 6 cells,
...    3CC CA and 8 UEs.

Force Tags    CONFIGURED    CRT    PY39    RAN_5G    RAN_5G_TDD    SBTS00
    ...    CLOUD_5G_I_LO_AP_LO
    ...    VARIANT_SANSA_FS_CPRI_CMWV_FDD+ECPRI_CMWV_TDD_AZQJ

Resource  resources/5GC002640_resources.robot

Suite Setup    Run keywords    Prepare suite environment  egate_config=${lua_cfg_file}  rad_params=@{SWCONFIG_FLAGS_LIST}
...                            ap_xml=${ap_xml}  scfc=${scfc}
...            AND  Create aliases
...            AND  Setup eNB Fsm Access  alias=gNB2

*** Variables ***
${lua_cfg_file}=  ${CFG_DIR}/egate_config_FDD_TDD_6Cells_SANSA_3CC_CA_8UEs.cfg
${ap_xml}=        ${CFG_DIR}/GNB_LO_AP_LO_FDD_TDD_2AEQE_6Cells_FS_SANSA_3CC_CA/iphy_AHLOA_AHFIA_AHFIB_AEQE_AEQE_6Cells_fts.xml
${scfc}=          ${CFG_DIR}/GNB_LO_AP_LO_FDD_TDD_2AEQE_6Cells_FS_SANSA_3CC_CA/SCFC_FDD_TDD_6Cells_FS_SANSA_3CC_CA_FTT_BF_fts.xml
${counters}       M55118C07001-M55118C07004,M55138C01503,M55138C02501,M55138C02502,M55139C01501,M55139C01502

*** Test Cases ***
5GC002640-AA-B4e_Addition_of_two_TDD_SCells_with_Beamforming_enabled_and_Beam_Refinement_deactivated
  [Documentation]
  ...  1.DESCRIPTION
  ...    This user scenario describes the 3CC blind SCells Addition procedure for single UE registered in FDD FR1 Cell.
  ...    2 TDD FR1 Cells should be successfully added as SCells and activated. In this case Beamforming on TDD FR1 SCells
  ...    is enabled with deactivated Beam Refinement.
  ...
  ...  2.TEST ENVIRONMENT AND SETTINGS
  ...    This item is testing in UTE environment:
  ...      * 5G Classical SA CMWV L1Bypass cloud test line (CLOUD_5G_I_BOO_AP_KLLL_SANSA_L1B_ECPRI_CMWV_TDD)
  ...      * gNB (ASIB, 2xABIO, AMIA), UE simulator (Airphone ASIK + 3xABIL), WTS 5G core simulator (Egate)
  ...      * gNB has configured 3CC for Carrier Aggregation: 1 Cell FDD and 2 Cells TDD (CA relations created)
  ...      * simulated Radio (AHLOA, AHFIB, AEQE, AEQE, AHCA)
  ...
  ...  2.1 Testing Tools
  ...    gNB - Nokia 5G BTS
  ...    Airphone (AP) - UEs simulator
  ...    WTS - ePC simulator - 5G core network simulator
  ...    Tcpdump & Wireshark - tools for capturing messages
  ...    BTSLog (cli) for collecting gNB & AP remote syslog
  ...    Robot Framework and Python runtime environment to automate the testing process
  ...    Web Element Manager
  ...
  ...  2.2 Test Automation
  ...    Robot Framework
  ...
  ...  3. DEFINITIONS FROM THE TEST SET
  ...    Test case covers: 5G_RAN_USR _RRM_4537
  ...
  ...  3.1 Definitions from the Test Plan
  ...    PCell - Primary Cell
  ...    SCell - Secondary Cell
  ...
  ...  3.2 Required Logs
  ...    Wireshark/TCPdump Logs (NGAP, NR-RRC, E1AP, F1AP)
  ...    TTI Trace
  ...    Counters
  ...    Default gNB & AP SysLog
  ...    BTS Snapshot
  ...    BIP logs
  ...    Sherpa Trace
  ...    AP sosReport
  ...
  ...  4. TESTING INSTRUCTIONS
  ...  4.1 Preconditions
  ...    Used HW: gNB (ASIB, 2xABIO, AMIA), UE simulator (Airphone ASIK + 3xABIL)
  ...    Simulated RRH (AHLOA) - gNB ABIO-1 RF1, AP ABIL-1:  Cell-1 - FDD FR1 10MHz ( band n71 )
  ...    Simulated RRH (AHFIB) - gNB ABIO-1 RF7, AP ABIL-2:  Cell-2 - FDD FR1 10MHz ( band n66 ), Cell-5 - FDD FR1 10MHz ( band n25 )
  ...    Simulated RRH (AEQE)  - gNB ABIO-2 RF1, AP ABIL-3:  Cell-3 - TDD FR1 60MHz ( band n41 )
  ...    Simulated RRH (AEQE)  - gNB ABIO-2 RF2, AP ABIL-3:  Cell-6 - TDD FR1 60MHz ( band n77 )
  ...    Simulated RRH (AHCA)  - gNB ABIO-1 RF2, AP ABIL-1:  Cell-4 - FDD FR1 10MHz ( band n5 )
  ...
  ...    Both TDD Cells are configured on the same RU so they are mapped to the same L2-RT instance!
  ...
  ...    gNB configuration:
  ...    - New L2RT architecture (CB007736) is enabled:
  ...        NRBTS/NRDU.flexibleCAMode = 2 (ConfigurationIndependent)
  ...    - Mobility support for mixed carrier aggregation (CB008015) is enabled:
  ...        NRBTS/NRDU.actConnectedModeMobilityCA = True
  ...    - All FDD cells are configured to allow SA access:
  ...        MRBTS/NRBTS/gNbCuType = SA+NSA
  ...        Each FDD Cell has configured MRBTS/NRBTS/NRCELL.cellDepType = SA+NSA
  ...    - Inter-band FDD + TDD FR1 DL CA feature (5GC002640) is activated and legacy CA features are activated too:
  ...        NRBTS/NRDU.carrierAggregationSupportList contains elements equal to 600 (ca_Fdd_Any_Sa), 200 (ca_Fdd_Fr1Tdd_Sa) and 3 (ca_Fdd_Fdd)
  ...    - CA relations are configured for each FDD cell by NRRELs pointing to:
  ...        2 TDD FR1 Cells: Cell-3 and Cell-6
  ...    - SCell addition method is set to blind:
  ...        each NRREL object NRBTS/NRCELL/NRREL.sCellAdditionMethod parameter is set to 0 (blind)
  ...    - SCell activation method is set to blind:
  ...        NRBTS.sCellActivationMethod = 0 (blind)
  ...    - 5GC002255 is activated:
  ...        NRBTS/NRDU.actInterNumerologyCa = True
  ...    - DRX is disabled in both FDD and TDD FR1 Cells:
  ...        NRBTS/NRCELL.actCDrx = False
  ...    - DSS features are disabled in FDD Cells:
  ...        NRBTS.actLteNrDss = False
  ...    - Aperiodic CSI is disabled in all Cells:
  ...        NRBTS.NRCELL.actAperCsi = False
  ...    - TDD Cells are configured with subframe configuration according to 5GC001116-B (TD LTE config 2 SSF6 starting from SFN 0):
  ...        frameStructureType = tdLte
  ...        guardPeriodLength = 6 symbols (SSF6)
  ...        lteToNrFrameShift = 0ms
  ...        prachConfiguration = 97 (format A2 in subframe 7)
  ...        ssBurstSetPeriod = 20ms
  ...    - TDD Cells are configured without beamforming:
  ...        NRBTS/NRCELL.actBeamforming = True
  ...    - Beam refinement on TDD Cells is disabled:
  ...        NRBTS/NRCELL.nrBtsBeamRefinementP2 = False
  ...    - TDD Cells are configured without 5GC002200:
  ...        NRBTS/NRCELL.dlMimoMode = 4x4 Open Loop Spatial Multiplexing
  ...    - Long PUCCH is enabled:
  ...        NRBTS/NRCELL.pucchModeSelect = longPucch
  ...    - FDM scheduling is enabled:
  ...        NRBTS/actFdmScheduling = True
  ...        NRBTS/NRCELL.actIncreasedFdmUsersPerSlot = True
  ...    - FDD and TDD Cells are configured and On-Air, FDD Cell-1 and 2 TDD Cells are active, FDD Cells 2, 4 and 5 are inactive
  ...    - During ICS, a format 3 PUCCH resource from Set1 was configured for pCSI reporting of the PCell or multiplexed pCSI & HARQ AN reporting
  ...    - NR-UE1 supports FDD-TDD 3CC CA with band combinations:
  ...        * CA_n66A-n71A-n77A (FDD n71 + FDD n66 + TDD n77),
  ...        * CA_n41A-n71A-n77A (FDD n71 + TDD n41 + TDD n77),
  ...        * CA_n41(2A)-n71A   (FDD n71 + TDD n41 + TDD n41),
  ...        * CA_n41C-n71A      (FDD n71 + TDD n41 + TDD n41)
  ...    - For BF configuration 2 TDD Cells have the same basic set of beams consisting of SS/PBCH beams and refined beams on gNB side:
  ...        NRBTS/NRCELL.basicBeamSet = beamSet_2
  ...        NRBTS/NRCELLGRP.numberOfTransmittedSsBlocks = 2
  ...
  ...  4.2 Test Steps
  ...    Step 1: Register 3CC CA capable NR-UE1 with supported band combination CA_n41A-n66A-n71A, CA_n41(2A), CA_n41C-n71A and CA_n41A-n71A-n77A
  ...            to FDD Cell-1.
  ...      Description: N/A
  ...      Expected: NR-UE1 signals the completion of the registration message NAS: Registration Complete to the AMF.
  ...            3CC CA capable NR-UE1 is successfully registered to FDD Cell-1.
  ...    Step 2: Set up PDU session for NR-UE1 to trigger two TDD SCells addition.
  ...      Description: N/A
  ...      Expected: 2 TDD Cells were added as SCells and blindly activated for NR-UE1. Verify messages flow:
  ...          gNB-CU sends F1AP: UE Context Modification Request towards gNB-DU with selected SCells - Cell-3 (TDD) and Cell-6 (TDD)
  ...              in SCell-ToBeSetupMod-List. IE allowedBC-ListMRDC with selected band combination CA_n41A-n71A-n77A is included in this message.
  ...          gNB-DU receives F1AP: UE CONTEXT MODIFICATION REQUEST.
  ...          gNB-DU sends to gNB-CU F1AP: UE CONTEXT MODIFICATION RESPONSE including:
  ...              - DUtoCURRCInformation IE with CSI-RS, PUCCH pCSI, HARQ ACK/NACK reporting configuration,
  ...              - for TDD SCells Cell-3 and Cell-6 SSB Beam reporting configuration (reportQuantity of CSI-ReportConfig set as ssb-Index-RSRP),
  ...              - maxMIMO-Layers configuration on DL for each CC (based UE capabilities),
  ...              - SelectedBandCombinationIndex,
  ...              - SelectedFeatureSetEntryIndex
  ...          gNB-CU shall receive F1AP: UE Context Modification Response from gNB-DU.
  ...          gNB-CU sends F1AP: DL RRC Message Transfer towards gNB-DU containing RRC: RRC Reconfiguration.
  ...          gNB-DU forwards that RRC: RRC Reconfiguration containing sCellToAddModList towards NR-UE1.
  ...          gNB-DU receives RRC: RRC Reconfiguration Complete from NR-UE1.
  ...          gNB-CU receives F1AP: UL RRC Message Transfer from gNB-DU containing that RRC: RRC Reconfiguration Complete.
  ...    Step 3: Collect DL and UL TTI Traces for each Cell and verify CSI measurements reports.
  ...      Description: N/A
  ...      Expected: NR-UE1 periodically reports CSI measurements (CQI and CRI) for PCell and 2 SCells.
  ...    Step 4: Collect PM Counters and verify if their values are correct.
  ...      Description: N/A
  ...      Expected: Check if corresponding counters for RAC and SCell Addition are updated accordingly for Cells 1, 3 and 6 (used in CA):
  ...          M55138C02501 - GNB_SCELL_2_ADMI_REQ_SA         = 1   for Cell-1 (PCell)  | = 0   for Cell-3 and Cell-6 (SCells)
  ...          M55138C02502 - GNB_SCELL_2_ADMI_SUCC_SA        = 1   for Cell-1 (PCell)  | = 0   for Cell-3 and Cell-6 (SCells)
  ...          M55138C01503 - GNB_SCELL_ADMI_UNSUCC_SA        = 0   for Cell-1 (PCell)  | = 0   for Cell-3 and Cell-6 (SCells)
  ...          M55139C01501 - GNB_DU_SCELL_2_ADMI_REQ_SA      = 1   for Cell-1 (PCell)  | = 0   for Cell-3 and Cell-6 (SCells)
  ...          M55139C01502 - GNB_DU_SCELL_2_ADMI_SUCC_SA     = 1   for Cell-1 (PCell)  | = 0   for Cell-3 and Cell-6 (SCells)
  ...          M55118C07001 - UE_PCELL_2_CONF_SCELL_DL_SA     = 230 for Cell-1 (PCell)  | = 0   for Cell-3 and Cell-6 (SCells)
  ...          M55118C07002 - UE_SCELL_2_CONF_SCELL_DL_SA     = 0   for Cell-1 (PCell)  | = 230 for Cell-3 and Cell-6 (SCells)
  ...          M55118C07003 - RRC_RECONF_ADD2DLSCELL_SUCC_SA  = 1   for Cell-1 (PCell)  | = 0   for Cell-3 and Cell-6 (SCells)
  ...          M55118C07004 - RRC_RECONF_ADD2DLSCELL_ATT_SA   = 1   for Cell-1 (PCell)  | = 0   for Cell-3 and Cell-6 (SCells)
  ...    Step 5: Release PDU session and deregister NR-UE1.
  ...      Description: N/A
  ...      Expected: PDU session is released and NR-UE1 is successfully deregistered.
  ...    Step 6: Repeat Steps 1-5 for different SS Beam configuration for both TDD Cells for NR-UE1.
  ...      Description: Set basicBeamSet for:
  ...          - TDD Cell-3: NRBTS/NRCELL.basicBeamSet = beamSet_4, NRBTS/NRCELLGRP.numberOfTransmittedSsBlocks = 4
  ...          - TDD Cell-6: NRBTS/NRCELL.basicBeamSet = beamSet_6, NRBTS/NRCELLGRP.numberOfTransmittedSsBlocks = 6
  ...      Expected: The same as in the previous steps. NR-UE1 is properly registered to FDD FR1 Cell-1, 2 TDD Cells are added and activated
  ...          for NR-UE1 as SCells.
  ...
  ...  4.3 Postconditions
  ...    Successful RRC Reconfiguration Completed message is received from the UE.
  ...    UE is configured with 3CC CA with one FDD FR1 Cell-1 as PCell and 2 TDD Cells as SCells.
  ...    UE is configured to perform periodic CSI Measurements on all carriers: PCell and 2 SCells
  ...      (CQI(Channel Quality Information) and CRI(CSI-RS Resource Indicator)).
  ...    UE is configured to periodically report CSI measurements:
  ...      - UE periodically reports CQI measurements of PCell via dedicated PUCCH Format3 resource on PCell Cell-1.
  ...      - UE periodically reports CQI measurements of each SCell via dedicated PUCCH Format3 resource on PCell Cell-1.
  ...    UE is configured to perform periodic SSB based CSI Measurements for TDD SCells Cell-3 and Cell-6.
  ...    UE is configured to report SSB Beam measurements for FR1-TDD cells via dedicated Format3 PUCCH resource on FDD PCell Cell-1.
  ...    All counters are updated accordingly.
  ...
  ...  5.REFERENCES
  ...    [1] CFAM for 5GC002640 - [LINK]
  ...
  ...  6.HISTORY
  ...    V 0.1:  2021.08.02:  Michal Obszarny:  test case drafted
  ...    V 0.2:  2021.09.10:  Michal Obszarny:  test case updated
  ...    V 0.3:  2021.09.15:  Michal Obszarny:  review created
  ...    V 1.0   2021.11.09:  Michal Obszarny:  review done: https://collab.ext.net.nokia.com/ui#review:id=844428

    [Setup]  Run keywords    Activate automatic PM Stats
             ...             Wait for next full PM Interval

    Change NR-UE1 3CC CA capabilities to support band combination CA_n41A-n71A-n77A, CA_n41A-n66A-n71A, CA_n41(2A)-n71A, CA_n41C-n71A
    Register 3CC CA capable NR-UE1 to gNB-2 Cell-1
    Establish PDU session for NR-UE1 to trigger successful 3CC CA

    Log to console  F1AP messages verification...
    Verify SCell-ToBeSetupMod-List IE whether both TDD Cells were selected to 3CC CA for NR-UE1
    Verify allowedBC-ListMRDC IE whether CA_n71A-n41A-n77A band combination was selected to 3CC CA for NR-UE1
    Verify sCellToAddModList IE whether both TDD Cells were added as SCells for NR-UE1
    Verify resourceSetToAddModList IE whether PUCCH resources were allocated correctly for BF enabled on both SCells for FTT 3CC CA NR-UE1
    Verify whether pCSI and HARQ AN and SSB Beam reporting configuration was sent for both TDD SCells for FTT 3CC CA for NR-UE1
    Verify iE-Extensions IE whether Selected Band Combination and Feature Set Entry Indexes were correct for FTT 3CC CA NR-UE1
    Verify spCellConfig and sCellToAddModList IEs whether maxMIMO-Layers DL and UL configuration was correct for NR-UE1

    Log to console  TTI Traces collecting...
    Collect TTI Traces during 5 seconds and save to directory 5GC002640_AA_B4e_3CC_CA_FTT
    Verify if CSI measurement reports are done via dedicated PUCCH format3  pcell=50  scells=52,55
    Verify if UE performs csi measurement reports on all carriers  phys_cells_ids=50,52,55
    Verify CSI reports DTX ratio  phys_cells_ids=50,52,55  accepted_ratio=10
    Verify that Beam reports are sent for cell  cell_id=52
    Verify that Beam reports are sent for cell  cell_id=55
    Verify if SSB Beam reports are done via dedicated PUCCH Format3

    Log to console  Counters verification...
    Wait for next full PM Interval
    Verify counters for successful 3CC FTT CA
    ${pm_counter_file}=    Get Latest Unpacked Full Pm Counters File
    Get counters value and report to rp  counters=${counters}  filepath=${pm_counter_file}  localmoid=NRCELL-1

    [Teardown]  Run keywords    Produce Scout Data                AND
    ...                         Release PDU session for NR-UE1    AND
    ...                         Deregister NR-UE1                 AND
    ...                         Deactivate automatic PM Stats
